diversity adds no value beyond slowing.

If MIXED beats both FAST and SLOW
while preserving reversal:

temporal heterogeneity earns an architectural role.

If FAST/MEDIUM/SLOW/MIXED all fail
on contexts 44-47:

the issue is not response resonance alone.

